== core middleware note on Provider-less sessions
//     a fresh sign-in. Protected routes are then rejected by RequireAuth.
//   - Cookie path, handle suspended (or otherwise non-active): clears
//     the cookie and returns 401 with a state-specific body.
//   - Bearer path, handle missing or non-active: returns 401 with a
//     state-specific body. No UI fallthrough — API clients re-auth.
//   - Active handle (either path): stamps the live (account_id, handle)
//     onto claims so downstream sees the live row, not stale cookie/JWT
